1
00:00:13,416 --> 00:00:15,632
[Episode 5]

2
00:00:19,125 --> 00:00:20,665
Can I help you?

3
00:00:20,665 --> 00:00:28,242
Yes, thanks. I wonder if we could borrow some...

4
00:00:42,210 --> 00:00:43,910
Who are you?

5
00:00:44,510 --> 00:00:46,630
Can't you recognize your mother and sister?

6
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:53,530
Why are you guys staring at me?

7
00:00:53,530 --> 00:00:55,330
Is there something on my face?

8
00:00:55,330 --> 00:00:58,440
There is. No joking, lots of stuff on your face.

9
00:01:10,970 --> 00:01:14,200
Alright, alright! I already made a promise.

10
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:18,530
Today at five, at the Seoul Hotel
first floor coffee shop... A guy...

11
00:01:18,530 --> 00:01:21,877
He works at Dongseong Trade,
has an 80-square-meter apartment in Gangnam,

12
00:01:21,877 --> 00:01:22,650
and his bank account...

13
00:01:22,650 --> 00:01:25,080
- Who?
- Your date.

14
00:01:25,080 --> 00:01:26,590
I'm set up for a blind date, mom?

15
00:01:26,590 --> 00:01:28,070
Alright, alright.

16
00:01:28,070 --> 00:01:33,150
If this date gets cancelled,
I'm going to dig a hole and bury myself.

17
00:01:33,150 --> 00:01:35,350
There's a lot riding on this!

18
00:01:35,350 --> 00:01:38,460
It's not a threat.
Mom looked at coffins a while ago.

19
00:01:38,460 --> 00:01:40,230
I looked at a blackish copper coffin.

20
00:01:40,230 --> 00:01:41,805
Give it up, mom.

21
00:01:41,805 --> 00:01:43,380
This doesn't have the slightest chance of happening.

22
00:01:43,380 --> 00:01:47,500
If Eunchae goes on this date then
I'll immediately go into Seoul University.

23
00:01:48,980 --> 00:01:54,080
Well yeah. If Eunchae goes...
Then I'll give you this bed, mom.

24
00:01:57,880 --> 00:02:04,550
Yeah. If she goes on this date,
you'll be her mother.

25
00:02:06,240 --> 00:02:08,060
I'll go on the date.

26
00:02:09,550 --> 00:02:12,680
With news as good as that,
you should have told me sooner.

27
00:02:15,300 --> 00:02:19,150
If I fall for him at first sight,
can I propose to him first, mom?

28
00:02:38,050 --> 00:02:40,410
Do you not like me?

29
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:46,660
It's not that I don't like you.
You're just not my type.

30
00:02:46,660 --> 00:02:49,610
What is your type?

31
00:02:49,610 --> 00:02:51,360
It's hard for me to say...

32
00:02:52,710 --> 00:02:55,110
Do you want to draw your type then?

33
00:02:58,450 --> 00:03:02,870
Ten minutes haven't even passed.
How can you tell if I'm your type or not?

34
00:03:04,420 --> 00:03:08,170
If you take a closer look, I might be your type.

35
00:03:08,170 --> 00:03:10,620
I can tell in one minute.

36
00:03:10,620 --> 00:03:14,460
How do you figure that out in a minute, huh? Nonsense.

37
00:03:14,460 --> 00:03:15,860
I can.

38
00:03:15,860 --> 00:03:18,660
- It doesn't make sense.
- Why not?

39
00:03:18,660 --> 00:03:21,260
- It doesn't
- It does!

40
00:03:32,610 --> 00:03:37,010
Tell me the truth.
What exactly don't you like about me?

41
00:03:37,010 --> 00:03:41,260
How can I say it directly?

42
00:03:41,260 --> 00:03:43,910
Tell me. It's alright.

43
00:03:43,994 --> 00:03:45,810
Geez.

44
00:03:46,510 --> 00:03:50,060
Since you're so insistent...

45
00:03:52,060 --> 00:03:55,610
I really don't like how you look. Happy now?

46
00:03:55,610 --> 00:03:58,060
What about how I look?

47
00:03:58,060 --> 00:04:00,530
Geez.

48
00:04:03,030 --> 00:04:04,920
Take a look in the mirror.

49
00:04:10,450 --> 00:04:13,010
Let's split the bill.

50
00:05:11,260 --> 00:05:15,510
I've got to go to the studio.
I don't think I can drive you.

51
00:05:15,510 --> 00:05:18,560
It's okay. That's why I brought my car.

52
00:05:20,590 --> 00:05:23,150
I'll call you. Get home safe.

53
00:05:42,890 --> 00:05:44,340
How can I help you?

54
00:05:46,280 --> 00:05:47,730
Hey!

55
00:05:47,730 --> 00:05:50,840
Lady! Get out.

56
00:05:56,190 --> 00:05:57,560
"Lady"?

57
00:05:57,560 --> 00:06:01,260
You... Where do you look when driving?

58
00:06:01,260 --> 00:06:03,210
Look here, guy.

59
00:06:03,210 --> 00:06:06,960
Lady, my baby is stuck beneath your car.

60
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:08,050
Huh?

61
00:06:13,500 --> 00:06:15,030
Oh my god!

62
00:06:15,710 --> 00:06:17,400
Move your car.

63
00:06:18,510 --> 00:06:20,560
Didn't you hear me?

64
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:22,560
I didn't know.

65
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:26,460
When I was parking, I didn't feel a thing.

66
00:06:26,460 --> 00:06:28,140
I didn't know.

67
00:06:29,390 --> 00:06:31,480
Move the car.

68
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:35,890
I'm sorry. I'm really sorry. I'll pay you.

69
00:06:44,140 --> 00:06:47,460
If this isn't enough, leave me with your number.

70
00:06:47,460 --> 00:06:50,140
You know who I am right? I'm Kang Minj?

71
00:06:52,650 --> 00:06:54,400
What is this?

72
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:57,510
What do you think you're doing?

73
00:06:58,710 --> 00:07:01,350
Are you trying to hit on me?

74
00:07:02,400 --> 00:07:06,600
Well, you picked the wrong person, man.

75
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:10,510
I'm Kang Minju! You can't be like this.

76
00:07:10,510 --> 00:07:12,850
Shut up and move your car.

77
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:16,700
You have one minute to get lost.

78
00:08:04,650 --> 00:08:05,600
Choi Yun!

79
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:08,400
Hi man. Where were you?

80
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:09,650
Where are you?

81
00:08:10,400 --> 00:08:13,060
The studio. Wanna come over?

82
00:08:13,900 --> 00:08:16,060
Am I officially your manager from today?

83
00:08:16,060 --> 00:08:18,890
Yeah, work officially starts tomorrow.

84
00:08:18,890 --> 00:08:23,060
Wait ten minutes.
I just got in a taxi... I'll be there soon.

85
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:19,230
What a poor, little puppy.

86
00:09:19,230 --> 00:09:22,030
I'll wash you up clean.

87
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:55,850
So you're not crazy.

88
00:09:59,980 --> 00:10:02,930
Fine then. Let's date.

89
00:10:07,260 --> 00:10:11,410
Am I a joke to you? Do I look like a pushover?

90
00:10:13,260 --> 00:10:18,590
If you show up again, you're dead meat!

91
00:10:48,370 --> 00:10:51,880
Why is that sound coming all the way through here?

92
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:54,330
Sangchae, wake up!

93
00:10:58,960 --> 00:11:03,150
Oh my. There is a photoshoot today, right?

94
00:11:03,150 --> 00:11:05,010
Yun. Son.

95
00:11:05,010 --> 00:11:09,110
Wake up and wash and then
let's get to the photoshoot.

96
00:11:09,110 --> 00:11:12,670
Not waking up?

97
00:11:12,670 --> 00:11:16,120
Get up, get up!

98
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:18,840
Hurry and get up, get up!

99
00:11:20,470 --> 00:11:22,340
Get up, get up!

100
00:11:23,870 --> 00:11:26,160
Just date your son, why don't you?

101
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:43,360
Disgusting!

102
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:46,050
Do you have a telephone pole stuck up your ears?

103
00:11:46,050 --> 00:11:51,070
I may have given birth to you
but you guys are pathetic!

104
00:11:54,650 --> 00:11:59,090
Audrey, birth name Jo Malbok.

105
00:11:59,090 --> 00:12:03,520
You're so full of yourself because of
your oh-so-great son.

106
00:12:03,520 --> 00:12:10,200
But I might just have Eunchae seduce him.

107
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:16,180
This headache of yours might just
give you a daughter-in-law!

108
00:12:20,910 --> 00:12:22,300
Fire!

109
00:12:23,190 --> 00:12:24,490
Fire!

110
00:12:24,490 --> 00:12:27,570
Samchae! Fire!

111
00:12:27,570 --> 00:12:29,510
Stop joking around.

112
00:12:30,130 --> 00:12:31,280
Are you up?

113
00:12:31,280 --> 00:12:33,480
I have been for a while.

114
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:35,240
Then why pretend to be asleep?

115
00:12:35,240 --> 00:12:36,600
Just because.

116
00:12:39,150 --> 00:12:43,940
I didn't want to open my eyes,
so I just lazily stayed put.

117
00:12:46,850 --> 00:12:51,860
Yun and his mother have a photo shoot
outside the city today.

118
00:12:51,860 --> 00:12:53,060
Yeah.

119
00:12:55,580 --> 00:12:57,280
Are you sick?

120
00:12:58,890 --> 00:13:02,870
Look at this sweat.

121
00:13:02,870 --> 00:13:04,640
You even have a fever!

122
00:13:05,470 --> 00:13:07,950
I'm a little sick, I guess.

123
00:13:07,950 --> 00:13:10,040
Do you think you can go?

124
00:13:10,040 --> 00:13:12,270
You're normally like steel.

125
00:13:12,270 --> 00:13:14,720
It's okay. I'll get better.

126
00:13:17,410 --> 00:13:21,040
Hello, doggy dog. Sleep well?

127
00:13:43,350 --> 00:13:45,000
Did you have a good night's sleep?

128
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:46,710
Yes. Good morning.

129
00:13:46,710 --> 00:13:51,190
Wake up Yun. I can't do a thing to wake him up.

130
00:13:51,190 --> 00:13:52,500
He's still sleeping?

131
00:13:52,500 --> 00:13:54,860
Yeah, he went to sleep late.

132
00:13:54,860 --> 00:13:57,220
He said he dreamed of a ghost.

133
00:13:57,220 --> 00:13:59,810
He even came into my room and slept with me.

134
00:13:59,810 --> 00:14:01,350
Okay.

135
00:14:01,350 --> 00:14:05,260
- Oh, Eunchae.
- Yes?

136
00:14:05,260 --> 00:14:10,860
Don't tell Minju about Yun being this way.

137
00:14:10,860 --> 00:14:11,960
Being what way?

138
00:14:11,960 --> 00:14:14,730
Like not being able to sleep alone after a scary dream,

139
00:14:14,730 --> 00:14:18,560
or how he's afraid of ghosts at his age.

140
00:14:18,560 --> 00:14:21,720
Sure. I won't tell her.

141
00:14:40,130 --> 00:14:44,590
Yun, wake up! You have a shoot to go to.

142
00:14:44,590 --> 00:14:46,720
Wake up, it's late.

143
00:14:47,350 --> 00:14:51,100
People are waiting for you. Are you going to cancel?

144
00:14:51,100 --> 00:14:54,200
I'm going to cancel.

145
00:14:56,660 --> 00:14:59,880
Wake up. Oh, good boy!

146
00:14:59,880 --> 00:15:02,840
I'm not good!

147
00:15:12,970 --> 00:15:16,180
You know about the Kong Kong Ghost right?

148
00:15:16,180 --> 00:15:20,470
The ghost who died falling upside-down
from a three story building?

149
00:15:20,470 --> 00:15:24,500
The ghost who walks on its head.
It sounds like "kong kong kong."

150
00:15:24,500 --> 00:15:27,820
The kong kong ghost is searching for the person

151
00:15:27,820 --> 00:15:30,370
who pushed her to her death.

152
00:15:30,370 --> 00:15:32,510
The pusher's name is Choi Yun.

153
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:38,070
Kong kong kong.

154
00:15:38,070 --> 00:15:41,580
It just opened the door and entered.

155
00:15:42,430 --> 00:15:44,880
Kong kong kong.

156
00:15:44,880 --> 00:15:48,440
It's gotten into the living room...

157
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:51,510
Kong kong kong.

158
00:15:51,510 --> 00:15:54,130
It goes up the stairs...

159
00:15:54,130 --> 00:15:56,550
Has it reached Yun's room?

160
00:15:59,070 --> 00:16:04,010
He's not in here...

161
00:16:05,550 --> 00:16:07,920
Kong kong kong.

162
00:16:07,920 --> 00:16:11,400
Then after that, it goes back downstairs...

163
00:16:11,400 --> 00:16:14,010
Kong kong kong.

164
00:16:14,010 --> 00:16:16,050
Finds out...

165
00:16:18,420 --> 00:16:22,460
that Yun is in his mom's room.

166
00:16:24,140 --> 00:16:30,100
Kong kong kong.

167
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:36,550
There is something laying down by your side.

168
00:16:37,580 --> 00:16:39,620
Sleep well with the kong kong ghost. I'm off.

169
00:16:39,620 --> 00:16:41,040
Hey!

170
00:16:58,160 --> 00:17:00,420
- Yun!
- Yes?

171
00:17:00,420 --> 00:17:02,610
Why don't you get off of me and go?

172
00:17:03,850 --> 00:17:05,380
Let go.

173
00:17:05,380 --> 00:17:07,120
No.

174
00:17:08,940 --> 00:17:13,310
Hey, am I your wife? Am I your mother?

175
00:17:13,310 --> 00:17:15,690
Why are you being so gross?

176
00:17:15,690 --> 00:17:16,920
What?

177
00:17:18,780 --> 00:17:21,240
What did you just say? I'm gross?

178
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:23,900
Yes, you are.

179
00:17:26,050 --> 00:17:28,010
That makes me depressed, Eunchae!

180
00:17:28,930 --> 00:17:30,680
Really depressed.

181
00:17:32,070 --> 00:17:34,120
I'm not going to the shoot today.

182
00:17:34,120 --> 00:17:36,150
Do whatever you want.

183
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:41,070
Is she on drugs?

184
00:17:47,600 --> 00:17:50,310
I should emigrate.

185
00:17:50,310 --> 00:17:53,050
Go and live away for ten years and come back.

186
00:18:01,050 --> 00:18:03,470
Am I really that sick?

187
00:18:07,050 --> 00:18:08,820
Get yourself together, Eunchae!

188
00:18:08,820 --> 00:18:11,760
Get yourself together.

189
00:18:35,330 --> 00:18:37,010
Why did you poke me?

190
00:18:37,930 --> 00:18:39,750
So it is you.

191
00:18:39,750 --> 00:18:41,150
Why poke me?

192
00:18:41,150 --> 00:18:47,190
I thought I was hallucinating and wanted to check...

193
00:18:47,190 --> 00:18:49,930
- Do you like me too?
- No!

194
00:18:49,930 --> 00:18:52,730
Then why poke a man minding his own business?

195
00:18:54,420 --> 00:18:57,820
You do you like me, right? So that's why you poked me.

196
00:18:57,820 --> 00:18:59,490
No!

197
00:19:01,360 --> 00:19:03,720
Your face isn't looking well. You sick somewhere?

198
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:05,270
No.

199
00:19:05,270 --> 00:19:08,340
- You look sick.
- No.

200
00:19:08,340 --> 00:19:12,340
- Your face is pale.
- No!

201
00:19:12,340 --> 00:19:15,160
- Is no the only thing you can say?
- No.

202
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:17,570
- You hate me, right?
- No...

203
00:19:31,530 --> 00:19:33,730
Am I a joke to you?

204
00:19:33,730 --> 00:19:35,330
Do I look like a pushover?

205
00:19:35,330 --> 00:19:40,820
If you show up again, you're dead meat!

206
00:19:44,190 --> 00:19:46,370
You stupid blockhead.

207
00:19:50,260 --> 00:19:51,430
Hey!

208
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:54,370
Hey!

209
00:19:57,010 --> 00:19:59,070
I warned you, didn't I?

210
00:19:59,070 --> 00:20:02,400
That if you showed up again, I'd kill you?

211
00:20:03,650 --> 00:20:07,760
I do what I say. If I say I'll kill you, I do it.

212
00:20:08,610 --> 00:20:10,380
Kill me.

213
00:20:10,380 --> 00:20:11,290
Hey.

214
00:20:11,290 --> 00:20:12,650
Kill me.

215
00:20:14,090 --> 00:20:15,850
You are crazy, huh?

216
00:20:19,150 --> 00:20:20,900
- Are you a pervert?
- Yeah.

217
00:20:24,970 --> 00:20:27,620
Go. Just go.

218
00:20:27,620 --> 00:20:30,590
Go back to your country.

219
00:20:30,590 --> 00:20:33,060
Go back to Australia.

220
00:20:33,680 --> 00:20:35,600
Go, I said go.

221
00:20:35,600 --> 00:20:38,400
I don't like you. You're seriously not my type.

222
00:20:38,400 --> 00:20:40,910
I don't even like thinking about guys
like you, so leave.

223
00:20:40,910 --> 00:20:43,540
Leave, please!

224
00:20:43,540 --> 00:20:45,340
What are you doing, Eunchae?

225
00:20:48,120 --> 00:20:51,030
Who are you to tell my bro to go or not?

226
00:20:51,030 --> 00:20:52,420
Sleep well?

227
00:20:53,220 --> 00:20:57,390
You sleep well too, bro? When'd you get here?

228
00:20:57,390 --> 00:20:58,660
An hour ago.

229
00:20:58,660 --> 00:21:00,790
I have a photo shoot with my mom today.

230
00:21:00,790 --> 00:21:03,050
Let's leave together when she comes out.

231
00:21:05,660 --> 00:21:06,750
Sure.

232
00:21:06,750 --> 00:21:10,740
This man... The new manager is this man?

233
00:21:10,740 --> 00:21:12,470
That's right, why?

234
00:21:12,470 --> 00:21:15,160
Are you nuts? Are you crazy?

235
00:21:15,160 --> 00:21:16,920
How can you hire a jerk like him?

236
00:21:16,920 --> 00:21:20,650
How can you talk like that? "A jerk like him?"

237
00:21:20,650 --> 00:21:24,170
He's older than you are. And...

238
00:21:26,050 --> 00:21:28,350
Are you on drugs today?

239
00:21:28,350 --> 00:21:31,050
From now on, I'm no longer your coordinator.

240
00:21:31,050 --> 00:21:32,790
Hire someone else.

241
00:21:35,880 --> 00:21:39,870
Sorry, sorry, sorry. We're late because of me, right?

242
00:21:39,870 --> 00:21:42,600
Mom, Eunchae says she won't
be my coordinator anymore.

243
00:21:42,600 --> 00:21:44,190
Why?

244
00:21:44,190 --> 00:21:46,480
I don't know. She says I should hire someone else.

245
00:21:46,480 --> 00:21:50,890
Why, Eunchae? Did Yun do something wrong again?

246
00:21:50,890 --> 00:21:53,840
How could he hire anyone else?

247
00:21:53,840 --> 00:22:00,560
No one can handle Yun but you.
They'd have to go to Mars to find someone else.

248
00:22:00,560 --> 00:22:02,740
It's not that.

249
00:22:02,740 --> 00:22:05,430
I'll scold Yun later.

250
00:22:05,430 --> 00:22:08,410
Lets go right now. We're late. Lets go.

251
00:22:12,650 --> 00:22:13,930
You?

252
00:22:14,790 --> 00:22:19,410
He became my manager yesterday, mom.
You know Muhyeok, right?

253
00:22:44,490 --> 00:22:47,990
It must be that time of the month for Eunchae.

254
00:22:47,990 --> 00:22:50,110
Yun...

255
00:22:50,110 --> 00:22:54,270
She's being a weird brat. She says I'm disgusting.

256
00:22:54,270 --> 00:22:58,370
And a while ago, she swore at Muhyeok,
calling him a jerk.

257
00:22:58,370 --> 00:23:00,120
She's crossing the line, that girl.

258
00:23:00,120 --> 00:23:03,790
She is a grown woman. Don't call her "girl."

259
00:23:05,080 --> 00:23:09,140
Eunchae, did you get this guy a job?

260
00:23:09,140 --> 00:23:12,360
No. No, ma'am.

261
00:23:13,900 --> 00:23:16,820
Isn't he your boyfriend, Eunchae?

262
00:23:16,820 --> 00:23:20,410
No, it's nothing like that.

263
00:23:20,410 --> 00:23:27,560
Eunchae, if you ask me who I'd choose
between Muhyeok and you,

264
00:23:27,560 --> 00:23:32,060
I'd choose Muhyeok no matter what.
Got that?

265
00:23:32,060 --> 00:23:38,310
Why? Because Muhyeok is cool! He's not a snob like you.

266
00:23:38,310 --> 00:23:39,790
Son!

267
00:23:39,790 --> 00:23:42,820
If anyone badmouths him again,

268
00:23:42,820 --> 00:23:46,690
they'll get it from me, no matter who. Got it?

269
00:24:25,350 --> 00:24:28,430
I'm being petty, huh?

270
00:24:28,430 --> 00:24:30,540
"Who does he think he is?"

271
00:24:30,540 --> 00:24:38,640
I'm immature, dirty, and nauseating.
And petty. And disgusting, right?

272
00:24:38,640 --> 00:24:41,070
You should at least say something.

273
00:24:42,210 --> 00:24:44,360
- Yun.
- What?

274
00:24:45,070 --> 00:24:46,900
Let's end things with no hard feelings.

275
00:24:46,900 --> 00:24:47,990
What?

276
00:24:48,860 --> 00:24:51,210
It's our last day, so I want to end it nicely.

277
00:24:52,330 --> 00:24:54,740
- Are you really going to quit?
- Yes.

278
00:24:54,740 --> 00:24:56,130
Hey.

279
00:24:56,130 --> 00:25:00,850
I am going to quit. Today is my last day.

280
00:25:08,470 --> 00:25:13,210
- Eunchae, you finish things up.
- Yes, ma'am.

281
00:25:13,210 --> 00:25:16,290
Mother, Eunchae is really going to quit today.

282
00:25:16,290 --> 00:25:17,980
Son...

283
00:25:17,980 --> 00:25:25,040
If you were to ask me to choose between
Eunchae and that Muhyeok guy or whoever,

284
00:25:25,040 --> 00:25:27,880
I'd pick Eunchae no matter what.

285
00:25:27,880 --> 00:25:30,230
What is wrong with everyone?

286
00:25:30,230 --> 00:25:31,900
I don't like that guy either.

287
00:25:31,900 --> 00:25:34,070
Why? What don't you like about him?

288
00:25:34,070 --> 00:25:35,790
I just don't.

289
00:25:35,790 --> 00:25:39,480
I don't like him. So cut the stubbornness.

290
00:25:42,020 --> 00:25:46,540
But he's a really cool guy. You don't even know him.

291
00:25:46,540 --> 00:25:51,350
Eunchae, I'm going to fire him no matter what.

292
00:25:51,350 --> 00:25:54,610
So you stay with Yun, okay?

293
00:27:20,770 --> 00:27:22,340
Mister!

294
00:27:23,840 --> 00:27:25,360
Mister!

295
00:27:29,570 --> 00:27:31,250
Mister!

296
00:27:31,250 --> 00:27:32,840
Mister!

297
00:27:34,320 --> 00:27:36,430
Pervert!

298
00:27:42,600 --> 00:27:44,210
Mister!

299
00:27:49,400 --> 00:27:51,100
Mister!

300
00:27:55,710 --> 00:27:57,310
Mister!

301
00:28:00,550 --> 00:28:02,480
Pervert!

302
00:28:11,910 --> 00:28:15,900
Mister!

303
00:28:34,890 --> 00:28:36,880
This sky isn't that great.

304
00:28:40,320 --> 00:28:43,030
The Australian sky is beautiful.

305
00:28:43,030 --> 00:28:45,400
Our country's sky is pretty too.

306
00:28:45,400 --> 00:28:47,410
Australia's is prettier.

307
00:28:47,410 --> 00:28:49,340
Then go back to Australia.

308
00:28:49,340 --> 00:28:53,080
If it's that pretty, go to your country
and live happily.

309
00:28:53,080 --> 00:28:54,900
Traitor.

310
00:28:55,670 --> 00:28:58,130
How would it feel to be up there?

311
00:29:02,720 --> 00:29:08,240
Would it look much better than it does from here?

312
00:29:09,000 --> 00:29:11,360
If you're so curious, then why don't you go?

313
00:29:12,970 --> 00:29:14,840
I am going.

314
00:29:17,410 --> 00:29:22,860
I'll be going there soon.

315
00:29:30,110 --> 00:29:32,120
Yes, ma'am?

316
00:29:32,120 --> 00:29:34,280
You're finished?

317
00:29:34,280 --> 00:29:38,460
I'm close by. I'll be there soon.

318
00:29:38,460 --> 00:29:39,750
Yes, ma'am.

319
00:29:42,440 --> 00:29:47,150
They're eating after the photo shoot.

320
00:29:49,330 --> 00:29:51,140
They're eating!

321
00:29:53,400 --> 00:29:56,580
Aren't you going to eat?
If you're getting fired anyway...

322
00:30:54,130 --> 00:30:58,240
Do you have money to buy a plane ticket?

323
00:31:00,840 --> 00:31:03,160
Want me to buy it for you?

324
00:31:06,190 --> 00:31:11,540
Yun is going to fire you. That's what was decided.

325
00:31:15,370 --> 00:31:17,800
I guess it's better this way.

326
00:31:17,800 --> 00:31:19,730
Instead of wearing yourself out about it,

327
00:31:19,730 --> 00:31:23,250
It's better to not start something
that isn't meant to happen.

328
00:31:25,790 --> 00:31:31,380
So... I'm not saying that it's happened to me before.

329
00:31:31,380 --> 00:31:34,340
But from my experience...

330
00:31:35,890 --> 00:31:38,970
Before we're too close and
before emotions get too deep,

331
00:31:38,970 --> 00:31:40,870
we should just end it quick.

332
00:31:40,870 --> 00:31:45,680
That way, we won't be hurt and
it'll be easier to forget...

333
00:31:45,680 --> 00:31:46,980
Mister!

334
00:31:48,020 --> 00:31:49,690
Mister!

335
00:32:30,540 --> 00:32:32,190
Welcome!

336
00:32:39,080 --> 00:32:41,100
This is the only place that's opened.

337
00:32:41,100 --> 00:32:44,500
I'll buy you something nice when we go back to Seoul.

338
00:32:44,500 --> 00:32:46,480
Well, nothing we can about that.

339
00:32:46,480 --> 00:32:48,120
Come sit here.

340
00:33:01,290 --> 00:33:02,660
Excuse me!

341
00:33:05,010 --> 00:33:06,660
What'll you have?

342
00:33:06,660 --> 00:33:10,110
- I'll have beef rib soup.
- I'll have beef soup.

343
00:33:10,110 --> 00:33:12,900
Our place has blood sausage and blood sausage soup.

344
00:33:12,900 --> 00:33:14,920
Would you like blood sausage?

345
00:33:14,920 --> 00:33:17,150
Sure, just give us those then.

346
00:33:18,300 --> 00:33:20,360
Then why even ask us?

347
00:33:25,540 --> 00:33:29,770
My stomach... I'll go to the restroom.

348
00:33:41,350 --> 00:33:43,750
Where's the restroom?

349
00:33:43,750 --> 00:33:48,530
Go straight... and then that way...

350
00:33:48,530 --> 00:33:52,390
And from there go that way...
and go straight and there it is.

351
00:34:03,260 --> 00:34:06,530
Where did that lady say it is?

352
00:34:06,530 --> 00:34:08,030
I don't know either.

353
00:34:13,340 --> 00:34:18,750
How can she put her finger in the soup and serve it?

354
00:34:18,750 --> 00:34:20,780
Let's just eat it, ma'am.

355
00:34:24,380 --> 00:34:26,960
- It's quite good.
- It's good.

356
00:34:26,960 --> 00:34:31,170
It's disgusting and dirty. How can you eat this?

357
00:34:32,940 --> 00:34:34,340
It's here.

358
00:34:34,340 --> 00:34:38,690
What is that? That's cow blood, right?

359
00:34:38,690 --> 00:34:41,880
I can't eat this.

360
00:34:41,880 --> 00:34:46,250
Just try some. It's really good.

361
00:34:47,320 --> 00:34:52,590
I've lost my appetite. I can't eat this stuff.

362
00:34:52,590 --> 00:34:57,070
This is what savages eat. Get it away from me.
You eat all of it.

363
00:35:02,820 --> 00:35:07,070
It's not for eating, it's for throwing on you.

364
00:35:07,070 --> 00:35:10,484
I should douse you with this soup!

365
00:35:10,484 --> 00:35:15,710
Eunchae! Yun! Yun! My Yun!

366
00:35:20,190 --> 00:35:21,710
Get back.

367
00:35:23,650 --> 00:35:24,960
Be quiet!

368
00:35:26,300 --> 00:35:27,530
Quiet!

369
00:35:28,707 --> 00:35:29,650
[Jeong Huisu]

370
00:35:29,650 --> 00:35:31,360
Jang Haesuk!

371
00:35:32,433 --> 00:35:34,999
[Kim Kyeong-eun]

372
00:35:35,940 --> 00:35:38,130
Kim Kangwoo... You two!

373
00:35:41,030 --> 00:35:43,280
Oh... The stench!

374
00:35:45,170 --> 00:35:47,320
I don't think I can do this here.

375
00:35:57,610 --> 00:35:58,880
Hello?

376
00:36:02,110 --> 00:36:05,460
Huh? What happened to my mother?

377
00:36:06,940 --> 00:36:12,250
I won't do anything! Let go!

378
00:36:12,250 --> 00:36:16,280
Don't, Eunchae. I want Yun to see all of this.

379
00:36:16,280 --> 00:36:18,610
Please calm down, ma'am.

380
00:36:18,610 --> 00:36:20,550
No. I can't!

381
00:36:20,550 --> 00:36:24,210
You! You messed with the wrong person today.

382
00:36:24,210 --> 00:36:28,590
Your business is over, lady!

383
00:36:28,590 --> 00:36:31,730
I'm going to tell my son and have this place torn down

384
00:36:31,730 --> 00:36:33,800
and have a new building built on top of it.

385
00:36:33,800 --> 00:36:38,530
What the heck is she blabbing about?
Let go! Let go!

386
00:36:40,250 --> 00:36:43,070
- Mom!
- Yun!

387
00:36:43,070 --> 00:36:44,690
What happened to your face?

388
00:36:44,690 --> 00:36:47,940
That lady... She poured that dirty food,

389
00:36:47,940 --> 00:36:50,800
that blood all over my face.

390
00:36:50,800 --> 00:36:52,570
What did you do, mom?

391
00:36:52,570 --> 00:36:55,000
What do you mean what did I do?

392
00:36:55,000 --> 00:36:58,210
I only said I can't eat the food
because it's not my liking,

393
00:36:58,210 --> 00:37:01,420
yet she did this to me!

394
00:37:01,420 --> 00:37:04,750
I'm so angry and feel so wronged!

395
00:37:04,750 --> 00:37:09,550
Look at her now trying to pour that on me again.

396
00:37:12,210 --> 00:37:16,150
This is the first time I've ever dealt with this.

397
00:37:16,150 --> 00:37:19,650
I'm so wronged I just want to die, Yun.

398
00:37:24,815 --> 00:37:26,860
[Together Forever]

399
00:37:26,860 --> 00:37:30,090
Son! Son!

400
00:37:34,210 --> 00:37:35,570
Son!

401
00:38:04,360 --> 00:38:06,340
Are you crazy?

402
00:38:06,340 --> 00:38:08,030
What are you doing?

403
00:38:08,030 --> 00:38:11,280
Have you gone insane? Stop!

404
00:38:54,170 --> 00:38:56,250
Head back first, ma'am.

405
00:38:56,880 --> 00:38:58,190
Why? What about you?

406
00:38:58,190 --> 00:39:00,162
I need to stop by somewhere.

407
00:39:00,162 --> 00:39:02,880
Stop by where? Do you know any place around here?

408
00:39:02,880 --> 00:39:05,960
I have a friend who lives nearby. Head back first.

409
00:39:05,960 --> 00:39:07,750
What friend?

410
00:39:07,750 --> 00:39:09,570
I know every one of your friends.

411
00:39:09,570 --> 00:39:11,280
Not this one.

412
00:39:11,280 --> 00:39:15,090
I'll see you in Seoul, ma'am.

413
00:39:37,110 --> 00:39:41,360
If they were adopted at that time...
These should be the babies.

414
00:40:03,570 --> 00:40:06,840
Can you make a copy of this for me?

415
00:40:36,030 --> 00:40:37,360
Excuse me?

416
00:40:41,030 --> 00:40:42,550
How may I help you?

417
00:40:42,550 --> 00:40:45,980
I just have some questions to ask.

418
00:40:45,980 --> 00:40:50,980
Does a Yun Seo-kyeong reside here?

419
00:40:52,050 --> 00:40:53,440
Yun Seo-kyeong?

420
00:40:53,440 --> 00:40:56,750
Yes, Yun Seo-kyeong.

421
00:40:56,750 --> 00:40:59,650
Oh that girl.

422
00:40:59,650 --> 00:41:03,980
She lived here for quite a while,
but she moved a few months ago.

423
00:41:05,860 --> 00:41:07,300
Moved?

424
00:41:07,300 --> 00:41:11,050
Yes. Why are you looking for her?

425
00:41:11,050 --> 00:41:13,590
It's nothing. Excuse me.

426
00:41:30,190 --> 00:41:36,840
What's the difference between Jjangoo and an octopus?

427
00:41:36,840 --> 00:41:42,280
Jjangoo and an octopus? What is the difference?

428
00:41:43,460 --> 00:41:46,210
Jjangoo...

429
00:41:46,210 --> 00:41:47,940
Well, Jjangoo...

430
00:41:47,940 --> 00:41:51,550
Jjangoo can't be caught while an octopus can be.

431
00:41:51,550 --> 00:41:54,440
Oh, that's true.

432
00:41:54,440 --> 00:41:56,980
It is, isn't it?

433
00:42:09,250 --> 00:42:14,050
You didn't have to go that far. You overreacted.

434
00:42:14,050 --> 00:42:16,440
We didn't have to go that far.

435
00:42:16,440 --> 00:42:20,300
That's why we paid them for the damage.

436
00:42:20,300 --> 00:42:22,550
Money isn't everything.

437
00:42:26,050 --> 00:42:29,650
Ah, I know now why Eunchae stayed behind.

438
00:42:29,650 --> 00:42:30,840
Why?

439
00:42:31,750 --> 00:42:33,420
The soup place.

440
00:42:34,340 --> 00:42:36,730
She probably went to that lady.

441
00:42:38,730 --> 00:42:42,530
She'd go there... I'm sure of it.

442
00:43:42,190 --> 00:43:46,090
Ma'am. Have a seat. I'll clean it for you.

443
00:43:46,090 --> 00:43:47,590
What are you doing?

444
00:43:47,590 --> 00:43:49,460
Just have a seat, ma'am.

445
00:43:49,460 --> 00:43:51,140
What are you doing?

446
00:43:51,840 --> 00:43:54,710
Turn around. A while ago, it seemed you hurt your back.

447
00:43:54,710 --> 00:43:56,620
I'll put a patch on it.

448
00:43:58,480 --> 00:44:01,420
Actually, would you rather go to the hospital with me?

449
00:44:03,640 --> 00:44:06,290
I'm tired. Mom, I wanna sleep.

450
00:44:06,290 --> 00:44:09,210
Okay. Sleep, my son.

451
00:44:10,870 --> 00:44:15,570
Were you alarmed? I'm sorry for that. It was my fault.

452
00:44:15,570 --> 00:44:18,890
It's okay. Sing me a lullaby.

453
00:44:18,890 --> 00:44:20,140
Okay.

454
00:45:32,620 --> 00:45:34,590
Yes, ma'am.

455
00:45:34,590 --> 00:45:36,790
I'm in front of the house.

456
00:45:36,790 --> 00:45:39,640
We will be arriving very soon.

457
00:45:39,640 --> 00:45:41,750
Yun is sleeping.

458
00:45:42,690 --> 00:45:46,070
Alright, see you later.

459
00:45:47,090 --> 00:45:49,480
Yun. Wake up!

460
00:45:49,480 --> 00:45:52,210
Son, wake up. We're home.

461
00:46:21,890 --> 00:46:23,790
Huh? Minju!

462
00:46:23,790 --> 00:46:26,000
Have fun?

463
00:46:26,980 --> 00:46:30,020
I missed you so much I thought I was going to die.

464
00:46:30,020 --> 00:46:32,520
Me too! Have a good time?

465
00:46:32,520 --> 00:46:33,670
Yeah.

466
00:46:34,390 --> 00:46:37,730
You can go home now. You did a good job.

467
00:46:39,370 --> 00:46:41,270
I'll call you.

468
00:46:41,270 --> 00:46:42,710
Let's go in.

469
00:46:59,140 --> 00:47:00,480
Is he your new manager?

470
00:47:00,480 --> 00:47:04,090
Yeah. But not after tomorrow.

471
00:47:04,090 --> 00:47:07,140
- That won't be necessary, Yun.
- Huh?

472
00:47:07,140 --> 00:47:10,460
I want to keep him for now.

473
00:47:10,460 --> 00:47:13,440
As you said, he might be an okay guy.

474
00:47:13,440 --> 00:47:16,090
I'll try to assure Eunchae about it.

475
00:47:17,090 --> 00:47:20,790
I'm hungry. Make me something good, son.

476
00:47:28,790 --> 00:47:32,710
Are you crazy?

477
00:47:32,710 --> 00:47:36,290
What are you doing?

478
00:47:36,290 --> 00:47:38,500
Have you gone insane? Stop!

479
00:48:20,670 --> 00:48:25,620
Are you okay?

480
00:48:32,440 --> 00:48:35,120
Did the train to Seoul leave?

481
00:48:35,120 --> 00:48:36,440
It left.

482
00:49:36,051 --> 00:49:39,716
[Inn]

483
00:50:03,190 --> 00:50:04,460
Ma'am!

484
00:50:04,460 --> 00:50:05,370
Yes?

485
00:50:05,370 --> 00:50:07,040
Where's my wife?

486
00:50:07,040 --> 00:50:08,340
She's in there.

487
00:51:37,480 --> 00:51:38,920
Open up!

488
00:51:40,960 --> 00:51:42,320
Open up!

489
00:51:44,790 --> 00:51:46,570
Open up!

490
00:52:04,896 --> 00:52:07,078
[My Eunchae]

491
00:52:07,640 --> 00:52:09,750
Recipient is not answering.

492
00:52:09,750 --> 00:52:12,090
Where is this girl?

493
00:54:29,435 --> 00:54:33,863
[Medicine Packet]

494
00:55:15,890 --> 00:55:18,940
Lady! Get out.

495
00:55:48,980 --> 00:55:51,340
You... live here?

496
00:55:57,460 --> 00:55:59,270
We've met before, right?

497
00:56:18,670 --> 00:56:21,960
You must be the new guy that moved in downstairs.

498
00:56:21,960 --> 00:56:24,620
What a small world, huh?

499
00:56:27,960 --> 00:56:32,190
All the better. That day was crazy.

500
00:56:32,190 --> 00:56:36,520
If it's alright with you,
I'd like to buy you a new dog.

501
00:56:42,210 --> 00:56:44,590
What do you think you're doing?

502
00:56:44,590 --> 00:56:47,020
Are you hitting on me?

503
00:56:49,230 --> 00:56:53,520
You got the wrong person, lady.

504
00:56:59,920 --> 00:57:01,090
Hey!

505
00:57:02,670 --> 00:57:04,570
How do people like that exist?

506
00:58:16,890 --> 00:58:20,230
Seo-kyeong. Why are you sleeping here?

507
00:58:21,140 --> 00:58:24,090
Why the floor and not the bed?

508
00:58:26,000 --> 00:58:28,230
Sleep comfortably on the bed.

509
00:58:52,000 --> 00:58:54,520
I told you to sleep on the bed!

510
00:59:01,960 --> 00:59:07,140
Mommy...

511
00:59:09,840 --> 00:59:11,820
How long do you intend to live this way?

512
00:59:11,820 --> 00:59:16,440
You want to live the rest of your life
stuck in a tiny place like that?

513
00:59:16,440 --> 00:59:18,500
Now you can live like a proper person...

514
00:59:18,500 --> 00:59:22,140
On a nice bed, wearing nice clothes, eating good food!

515
00:59:22,140 --> 00:59:27,790
I, your brother, am giving this life to you.

516
00:59:27,790 --> 00:59:29,840
Why are you driving me crazy?

517
00:59:29,840 --> 00:59:34,340
Mommy...

518
00:59:34,340 --> 00:59:37,590
Shut up! Quiet!

519
00:59:38,540 --> 00:59:41,960
What did Mom do for you that you'd call her?

520
00:59:41,960 --> 00:59:46,320
Where's mother? Where is a mother for us?

521
00:59:46,320 --> 00:59:48,940
Mother...

522
00:59:48,940 --> 00:59:53,670
Shut up! Be quiet, you idiot!

523
00:59:53,670 --> 00:59:56,020
My mother is not an idiot.

524
01:00:02,070 --> 01:00:04,090
Galchi...

525
01:00:04,090 --> 01:00:08,190
- Mom...
- Galchi...

526
01:00:09,500 --> 01:00:11,730
Did you hit my mother?

527
01:00:12,590 --> 01:00:18,710
Galchi, let's go back to our home.

528
01:00:18,710 --> 01:00:21,820
Okay... Okay.

529
01:00:21,820 --> 01:00:23,640
Let's go home.

530
01:00:23,640 --> 01:00:25,460
Let's go home, mom.

531
01:00:42,590 --> 01:00:43,790
Let's go, mom.

532
01:00:56,730 --> 01:00:58,460
Who was it?

533
01:01:00,140 --> 01:01:01,960
Was it Yun?

534
01:01:12,590 --> 01:01:14,940
Why don't just you kill me, you brat?

535
01:01:14,940 --> 01:01:17,140
Just worry me to death!

536
01:01:17,960 --> 01:01:19,420
Friend? Yeah right.

537
01:01:19,420 --> 01:01:21,980
You went to the soup place, right? I just know it.

538
01:01:21,980 --> 01:01:24,460
I mean, Muhyeok caused the damage,
so why did you settle things?

539
01:01:24,460 --> 01:01:26,250
Do you have that much strength?

540
01:01:26,250 --> 01:01:29,230
You look like a light breeze
would knock you over.

541
01:01:29,230 --> 01:01:32,730
Look at you looking all gaunt.

542
01:01:32,730 --> 01:01:33,750
Yun...

543
01:01:33,750 --> 01:01:36,920
I stayed up all night because of you. You know that?

544
01:01:36,920 --> 01:01:37,890
I do.

545
01:01:37,890 --> 01:01:40,120
What do you know?

546
01:01:40,120 --> 01:01:42,840
I thought it was you.

547
01:01:44,000 --> 01:01:45,190
What?

548
01:01:46,170 --> 01:01:51,370
I knew you were the one
taking care of me all night.

549
01:01:52,250 --> 01:01:55,940
What are you talking about?

550
01:01:55,940 --> 01:01:58,520
Thank you, Yun.

551
01:01:58,520 --> 01:02:00,890
I'm really really thankful.

552
01:02:02,140 --> 01:02:04,870
If not for you, I...

553
01:02:07,020 --> 01:02:11,790
I would have died.

554
01:02:17,670 --> 01:02:21,120
Thank you for saving my life, Yun.

555
01:02:21,120 --> 01:02:24,040
Hey, why are you crying all of sudden?

556
01:02:24,040 --> 01:02:28,590
For not knowing your heart,
and for getting angry at you...

557
01:02:28,590 --> 01:02:31,750
I'm so sorry, Yun.

558
01:02:31,750 --> 01:02:37,440
For being mean to you... and making you sad...

559
01:02:37,440 --> 01:02:40,090
I'm so sorry.

560
01:02:40,090 --> 01:02:44,960
No, I'm more sorry, actually.

561
01:02:46,290 --> 01:02:49,590
I was wrong, Eunchae.

562
01:02:49,590 --> 01:02:53,620
I won't do that again...

563
01:02:57,190 --> 01:03:02,120
Me too... I won't do that again too.

564
01:03:02,120 --> 01:03:06,690
I won't do that again...

565
01:03:22,704 --> 01:03:24,246
[Episode 6 Preview]

566
01:03:24,246 --> 01:03:26,495
You're like a sloppy child

567
01:03:26,495 --> 01:03:29,790
with food on your face.

568
01:03:30,143 --> 01:03:33,321
Get out of my face, you brats!

569
01:03:36,760 --> 01:03:40,792
You're so pretty, my sister.

570
01:03:43,464 --> 01:03:46,573
What will I do if Minju dumps me?
Then I'm going to kill myself.

571
01:03:46,573 --> 01:03:47,740
Die then.

572
01:03:47,740 --> 01:03:49,813
Are you Song Eunchae? Please let us interview you.

573
01:03:49,813 --> 01:03:51,804
Are the news reports about your relationship true?
